FerrionOS change to Redox base (MIT licence, kept), made against upstream commit 20f7573b4dc011ea5267189185edc0b2f12bab0f:
- fbbootlogd draws a boot splash instead of the boot log when /scheme/sys/env has QUIET=1: the background color from BOOT_BACKGROUND (the FerrionOS ground #0f0e0c without it), the FerrionOS mark where the login screen shows it next, and in place of the name under it a progress bar that moves on boot events read from the log (splash.rs lists them); any key shows the log;
- console-draw lets a TextScreen be hidden and shown again, and lets a caller draw on a V2DisplayMap.

